      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 46 for SLE 15 SP3)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 5.3.18-150300_59_167 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2022-49014: net: tun: Fix use-after-free in tun_detach() (bsc#1232818).\n- CVE-2022-49563: crypto: qat - add param check for RSA (bsc#1238788).\n- CVE-2022-49564: crypto: qat - add param check for DH (bsc#1238790).\n- CVE-2024-41090: tap: add missing verification for short frame (bsc#1228714).\n- CVE-2024-56600: net: inet6: do not leave a dangling sk pointer in inet6_create() (bsc#1235218).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2025-1254,SUSE-2025-1255,SUSE-SLE-Live-Patching-12-SP5-2025-1254,SUSE-SLE-Module-Live-Patching-15-SP3-2025-1255",
        "title": "Patchnames"
